      "originalText": "Features:\n1. One to One Chat\n2. Group Chat (Max 200 members)\n3. Presence Detection (Online/Offline)\n4. Keeping a History of Messages\n    Fetch Last N Messages\n5. Users must receive message even when offline\n6. Notification System to alert for offline message ",
