    {
      "id": "E0Y3MEj1svgrP129PvI--",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3239.1569162644228,
      "y": -201.8000164756263,
      "width": 776.2683715820312,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f9f8fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 874038288,
      "version": 1784,
      "versionNonce": 872843748,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752818770824,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Have group chat to\ncontain the user\n2. Have user table to\nhave the group chat\n3. Send this response to sender\n{\n    type: GROUP_CHAT_JOINED,\n    groupChatId: id,\n    groupChatName: groupChatName\n} => Add to client side state so it is visible",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Have group chat to\ncontain the user\n2. Have user table to\nhave the group chat\n3. Send this response to sender\n{\n    type: GROUP_CHAT_JOINED,\n    groupChatId: id,\n    groupChatName: groupChatName\n} => Add to client side state so it is visible",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3Vu0wdnEX36kXvdLNwJoO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4224.161786520198,
      "y": -4131.315750673388,
      "width": 2228.11279296875,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f9f8fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1115231248,
      "version": 918,
      "versionNonce": 1826760828,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1752736949274,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Database Schemas:\nPostgres for most of the stuff, Cassandra for Chat Message Storage.\nWhy Postgres:\n1. Generic Data\n2. Replication and Sharding can take care of availability and scalability requirements\nWhy Cassandra(Key Value Store):\n1. Easy Horizontal Scaling\n2. Low Latency\n3. We have more writes than reads.\n4. If we were to have random access, in relational db it will have a long tail, indexes grow large and random access is expensive",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Database Schemas:\nPostgres for most of the stuff, Cassandra for Chat Message Storage.\nWhy Postgres:\n1. Generic Data\n2. Replication and Sharding can take care of availability and scalability requirements\nWhy Cassandra(Key Value Store):\n1. Easy Horizontal Scaling\n2. Low Latency\n3. We have more writes than reads.\n4. If we were to have random access, in relational db it will have a long tail, indexes grow large and random access is expensive",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
