      "text": "1. Get the friends\nfrom db.\n2. Get the groups \nfrom db\n3. Send them to user\n4. Send this to user\n{\n  type: \"INIT_DATA\"\n  friends: all friends username\n  groups: all group userid\n}\n5. Send the unread messages to \nuser",
