      "updated": 1753684862568,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Check if already exist \n2. does not exist\n3. Add the receiver in\nsender's user table\n4. Add the sender in \nreceiver's user table\n5. Send this response to sender\n{\n    type: NEW_ONE_TO_ONE_CHAT_AP,\n    from: sender-user-id\n    to: receiver-user-id\n} => Add to client side state so it is visible\n6. 5. Send this response to receiver\n{\n    type: NEW_ONE_TO_ONE_CHAT_AP,\n    from: sender-user-id\n    to: receiver-user-id\n} => Add to client side state so it is visible",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Check if already exist \n2. does not exist\n3. Add the receiver in\nsender's user table\n4. Add the sender in \nreceiver's user table\n5. Send this response to sender\n{\n    type: NEW_ONE_TO_ONE_CHAT_AP,\n    from: sender-user-id\n    to: receiver-user-id\n} => Add to client side state so it is visible\n6. 5. Send this response to receiver\n{\n    type: NEW_ONE_TO_ONE_CHAT_AP,\n    from: sender-user-id\n    to: receiver-user-id\n} => Add to client side state so it is visible",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
